  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the worcestershire sauce, kombu-cold-extract, and curry powder, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the lamb is tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
